---
/** The thin chevron of the mockup after a choice that opens a list: it points down. Drawn for the site. */
---

<svg
  aria-hidden="true"
  class="chevron-down"
  fill="none"
  focusable="false"
  stroke="currentColor"
  viewBox="0 0 14 8"
  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
>
  <path d="M1 1 7 7 13 1" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" />
</svg>

<style>
  /* 14 by 8px beside a text of 24px, as in the mockup. */
  .chevron-down {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    inline-size: 0.6em;
    block-size: auto;
  }
</style>
